Last Update: CO V.10 Summer Expansion Update

Embark on a tail-wagging journey in the enchanting world of Canine Odyssey, where the pitter-patter of pawprints leads to thrilling adventures, charming friendships, and epic quests! This dog game invites players to step into the furry paws of their very own canine companion, exploring a vibrant and immersive open-world environment filled with mysteries, challenges, and heartwarming moments. 

Credits (Meet the Team!):
@Wubbox - (Main Developer) Model Design, Animations, Map Design, UI Design.
@MjorDunce - (Main Developer) Main Programmer, UI Design, Game Design.
@ZeiraWolfYT - (Jr. Developer) Main Accessory Designer.
@fwuairy - (Marketing Artist) Main Artist for Icons, Promotional Artwork for Canine Odyssey.
